# Base image findings we cannot fix from here. Everything else still fails the
# build — this file is for things with no action available to us, not for
# silencing the scanner. Revisit when node:22-slim ships a newer npm.

# node-tar bundled inside npm itself, in /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm.
# It is not in our dependency tree (npm ls tar is empty), npm is never invoked
# at runtime, and the image runs as a non-root user. Fixed in tar 7.5.19, which
# will arrive with a base image bump.
